      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-6728\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">1.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/631#1096\">Determining if a Rule Given by a Mapping Diagram Is a Function</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"6728\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-6728\"/></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Is the above rule a function?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 10:01 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:17</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
